    <unit id="privacy_rights_withdraw" name="privacy.rights.withdraw"><segment><source>privacy.rights.withdraw</source><target>Right to withdraw consent at any time; withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing before it (Art. 7(3) GDPR).</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_rights_complaint" name="privacy.rights.complaint"><segment><source>privacy.rights.complaint</source><target>Right to lodge a complaint with the Office for Personal Data Protection (ÚOOÚ), Pplk. Sochora 27, 170 00 Prague 7,</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_objection_title" name="privacy.objection.title"><segment><source>privacy.objection.title</source><target>Right to object</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_objection_text" name="privacy.objection.text"><segment><source>privacy.objection.text</source><target>Where we process your data based on legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR), you can object at any time on grounds relating to your particular situation. We will then stop processing it unless we demonstrate compelling legitimate grounds that override your interests or need it to establish or defend legal claims (Art. 21(1) GDPR).</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_objection_marketing" name="privacy.objection.marketing"><segment><source>privacy.objection.marketing</source><target>You can object to processing for direct marketing at any time without giving a reason; we will then stop processing the data for that purpose (Art. 21(2) and (3) GDPR).</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_cookies_title" name="privacy.cookies.title"><segment><source>privacy.cookies.title</source><target>Cookies and similar technologies</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_cookies_intro" name="privacy.cookies.intro"><segment><source>privacy.cookies.intro</source><target>We store necessary items without consent because the website needs them to work (Section 89(3) of Act No. 127/2005 Coll.). Other categories load only after you consent in the cookie banner, and you can change your consent at any time.</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_cookies_intro_necessary_only" name="privacy.cookies.intro_necessary_only"><segment><source>privacy.cookies.intro_necessary_only</source><target>The website only uses the necessary technical items listed below, which do not require consent under Section 89(3) of Act No. 127/2005 Coll. We use no analytics or marketing cookies.</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_cookies_none" name="privacy.cookies.none"><segment><source>privacy.cookies.none</source><target>The website stores no cookies or similar data on your device and loads no third-party content that would do so.</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_cookies_consent_mode_basic" name="privacy.cookies.consent_mode_basic"><segment><source>privacy.cookies.consent_mode_basic</source><target>Google tools (Google Analytics, Google Ads) load only after you consent to the relevant category (Google Consent Mode v2, basic mode). Nothing is sent to Google before consent.</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_cookies_consent_mode_advanced" name="privacy.cookies.consent_mode_advanced"><segment><source>privacy.cookies.consent_mode_advanced</source><target>Google tools (Google Analytics, Google Ads) use Google Consent Mode v2 in advanced mode: before consent they load without storing cookies and send signals without identifiers, which still contain technical data such as the IP address and browser type. Full measurement starts only after your consent.</target></segment></unit>
