    <unit id="privacy_contact_text" name="privacy.contact.text"><segment><source>privacy.contact.text</source><target>Send questions and requests about personal data to</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_contact_response" name="privacy.contact.response"><segment><source>privacy.contact.response</source><target>We will reply without undue delay and within one month at the latest; in complex cases we may extend this by two further months and will let you know (Art. 12(3) GDPR).</target></segment></unit>
    <unit id="privacy_contact_authority" name="privacy.contact.authority"><segment><source>privacy.contact.authority</source><target>If you are not satisfied with our reply, you can contact the Office for Personal Data Protection (ÚOOÚ), Pplk. Sochora 27, 170 00 Prague 7 (uoou.gov.cz).</target></segment></unit>
